%% US-317: NOSTR Caching Layer - Data Flow
%% Shows how data flows through the caching system

sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Component
    participant RQ as React Query
    participant EC as EventCacheService
    participant MC as Memory Cache
    participant IDB as IndexedDB
    participant R as NOSTR Relay

    Note over C,R: Event Fetch Flow (Cache Miss)
    C->>RQ: useEvent(eventId)
    RQ->>EC: get(eventId)
    EC->>MC: Check memory cache
    MC-->>EC: null (miss)
    EC->>IDB: Check IndexedDB
    IDB-->>EC: null (miss)
    EC-->>RQ: null
    RQ->>R: Fetch from relay
    R-->>RQ: Event data
    RQ->>EC: set(event)
    EC->>MC: Store in memory
    EC->>IDB: Persist to IndexedDB
    EC-->>RQ: Success
    RQ-->>C: Event data
